        <mxCell id="notes" value="PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; UQ = unique; ? = nullable; * = zero or more.&lt;br&gt;Each profile belongs to one user. Each project has one responsible graduate.&lt;br&gt;REVIEWS targets exactly one user, project or document. Actor and target FKs are enforced.&lt;br&gt;USERS also has 1 : 0..* links to uploaded DOCUMENTS and authored REVIEWS; lines omitted for clarity." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#182b3a;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
